          "user_request": "At present the time taken from first prompt to dispatching the client workflow with workflow server is too long. I suspect a lot of the preamble can be scripted with Python or TypeScript, e.g. workflow discovery. Workflows have embedded keywords to aid discovery. Maybe we can add a discover-workflow tool that permits fuzzy discovery based upon keywords provided by an agent. Measure time to dispatch client and use this as a reference for optimisation. Consider other novel techniques also like scripts, new workflow-server MCP tools, or other.",
